<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black">3.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black">本次比赛场地塑胶跑道<SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: 1pt">，</SPAN>比赛所用钉鞋一律要按规定的鞋钉要求<SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: 1pt">，</SPAN>否则不得穿钉鞋比赛，违者赔偿场地损失费。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black">4.</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>不明事宜由体育组负责解释。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black"><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">                                                   </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>绍兴一中校长室</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=3><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">                                             </SPAN><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">          </SPAN></FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2017</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>年</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">10</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>月</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">24</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>日</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 18pt; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 黑体; mso-font-width: 150%"><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" align=center><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 18pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-font-width: 150%'>大</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 18pt; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 黑体; mso-font-width: 150%"><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">  </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 18pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-font-width: 150%'>会</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 18pt; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 黑体; mso-font-width: 150%"><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">  </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 18pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-font-width: 150%'>纪</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 18pt; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 黑体; mso-font-width: 150%"><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">  </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 18pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-font-width: 150%'>律</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 18pt; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 黑体; mso-font-width: 150%"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 25pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 黑体"><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 25pt; TEXT-INDENT: 14pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 1.0"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>一、在运动会期间，人人讲文明，讲礼貌，讲道德，讲风尚，提倡做文明观众，争创优秀运动员。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: black"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 25pt; TEXT-INDENT: 14pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 1.0"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>二、服从大会指挥，按竞赛规程参加比赛。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: black"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 25pt; TEXT-INDENT: 14pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 1.0"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>三、比赛时做到胜不骄，败不馁，努力拼搏，创造最佳成绩。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: black"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 25pt; TEXT-INDENT: 14pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 1.0"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>四、赛前做好准备，穿好运动服装，按时参加点名，如遇到项目冲突和特殊情况时，一定要办好请假手续，不能冒名顶替。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: black"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 25pt; TEXT-INDENT: 14pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 1.0"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>五、不给运动员陪跑，不在运动场地乱窜乱跑，不参加比赛的同学严格按指定位置就座观看，注意安全，防止伤害事故发生。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: black"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 25pt; TEXT-INDENT: 14pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 1.0"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>六、集体项目各班要认真组织好班级参赛人员与队伍准时参加比赛。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 25pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: black"><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 25pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" align=center><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-font-width: 150%'>入场式方法及要求</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 黑体; mso-font-width: 150%"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoDate style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 27pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" align=center><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; mso-font-width: 150%"><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 27pt; TEXT-INDENT: 14pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 1.0"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: black">1.</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>各班参加入场式的人数为</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: black">8</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>路纵队，指定</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: black">1</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>名</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>（女生）<SPAN style="COLOR: black">同学拿班级牌<B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal">（</B></SPAN><B>服装统一为裙子、衬衣、背心、领结</B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal">）</B><SPAN style="COLOR: black">。</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: black"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 27pt; TEXT-INDENT: 14pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 1.0"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: black">2.</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>班级队伍选定一名指挥员喊口令，精神饱满，朝气蓬勃，体现班级风貌。</SPAN><B><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: black"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 27pt; TEXT-INDENT: 14pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 1.0"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: black">3.</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>各班队伍经主席台前必须目光朝主席台（行注目礼）可以变换队形（不准燃放礼花等影响环境物品）。绕场至司令台对面跑道中间，各班成一路纵队进入（开幕式）指定地点集合。</SPAN><B><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: black"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: black"><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">  </SPAN>4.</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>入场式设最佳组织奖、由大会评分组评定。</SPAN></P>
    
